  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading of Beterou-Tchaourou-Nigeria Border Road Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of the project are to provide accessibility to the Borgou Province and boost commercial exchange between Benin, Togo, Burkina Faso and Nigeria. It will improve accessibility to markets in the project zone and ensure easier movement of people and goods under improved safety conditions</narrative>
  </description>
